  "description": "Version-23 64-episode State College pilot for 2,500 individual evacuees. The actor receives complete semi-Markov Monte Carlo return-to-go centered only by lagged regime/decision-position baselines; the factorized critic receives independent one-step TD(0) labels. NMCC exact branches train auxiliary natural and causal world heads but have zero direct actor credit, guidance, and imitation weight. Actor and critic use disjoint optimizers, one versus four epochs, and KL-violating actor epochs are rolled back.",
